{"unit_id":"aadmin61-design__dsh-selection-chat#card-zh","repo":"aadmin61-design/dsh-selection-chat","commit":"0d63524e9fecb912b81aecba927817518d0ecd5d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Selection Chat 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的对话引用与侧边聊天插件。它在会话正文中提供划词操作，可把选中文本作为引用卡片附加到当前问题，也可据此创建继承已完成上下文的侧边分支会话。用户可以在侧栏继续对话、保存为长期会话，或关闭并清理临时会话；引用随原生消息提交，并在失败时恢复。适合需要引用旧回答、并行追问或暂存分支讨论的 DSH 用户。无需额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:255-283","client.js:407-432","temporary.mjs:71-153"]}
{"unit_id":"aadmin61-design__dsh-selection-chat#card-en","repo":"aadmin61-design/dsh-selection-chat","commit":"0d63524e9fecb912b81aecba927817518d0ecd5d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Selection Chat adds quoting and side chats to DSH web. Select text to attach it to your next message or open a sidebar branch based on completed turns. Save a temporary branch as a regular session, or close it for cleanup. Failed sends restore quotes. No extra API key or service required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:255-283","client.js:407-432","temporary.mjs:71-153"]}
