{"unit_id":"aadmin61-design__dsh-selection-chat#feature-quote","repo":"aadmin61-design/dsh-selection-chat","commit":"0d63524e9fecb912b81aecba927817518d0ecd5d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Selection Chat 的功能「引用对话选区」：在会话正文选中文字后，可添加到输入区上方的引用卡片；发送时引用与消息一并提交，失败时会恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:96-152"]}
{"unit_id":"aadmin61-design__dsh-selection-chat#feature-side-chat","repo":"aadmin61-design/dsh-selection-chat","commit":"0d63524e9fecb912b81aecba927817518d0ecd5d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Selection Chat 的功能「侧边分支聊天」：从选中文字打开继承已完成轮次的临时侧边会话，主会话保持独立；创建失败后重试会复用已创建的分支。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:255-283"]}
{"unit_id":"aadmin61-design__dsh-selection-chat#feature-save","repo":"aadmin61-design/dsh-selection-chat","commit":"0d63524e9fecb912b81aecba927817518d0ecd5d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Selection Chat 的功能「保存侧聊」：点击侧栏保存，将临时分支复制为长期会话并替换当前标签；后续消息继续写入保存后的会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:407-432"]}
{"unit_id":"aadmin61-design__dsh-selection-chat#feature-cleanup","repo":"aadmin61-design/dsh-selection-chat","commit":"0d63524e9fecb912b81aecba927817518d0ecd5d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Selection Chat 的功能「关闭临时会话」：关闭临时侧聊标签时请求清理其会话句柄；清理失败会显示提示并有限重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:232-254"]}
{"unit_id":"aadmin61-design__dsh-selection-chat#feature-quote-store","repo":"aadmin61-design/dsh-selection-chat","commit":"0d63524e9fecb912b81aecba927817518d0ecd5d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Selection Chat 的功能「管理引用卡片」：引用卡片可展开、移除；引用暂存于当前窗口的 sessionStorage，超长内容会提示缩小选区。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:96-152"]}
{"unit_id":"aadmin61-design__dsh-selection-chat#caveat-session-storage","repo":"aadmin61-design/dsh-selection-chat","commit":"0d63524e9fecb912b81aecba927817518d0ecd5d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"引用卡片暂存于浏览器 sessionStorage，刷新后可恢复；窗口关闭后不保证保留，见 client.js:96-105。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:96-105"]}
{"unit_id":"aadmin61-design__dsh-selection-chat#caveat-volatile-chat","repo":"aadmin61-design/dsh-selection-chat","commit":"0d63524e9fecb912b81aecba927817518d0ecd5d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"未保存的临时侧边会话驻留运行时内存；退出或重启 DSH 后无法恢复，需先保存，见 temporary.mjs:24-28。","source":"generated","evidence":["temporary.mjs:24-28"]}
